@EROChicago officers in Milwaukee rushed to help an injured woman trapped in her vehicle after a horrific, multi-vehicle rollover crash.

🔊Listen to the 911 call describing our officers arriving on scene.

🔎Although some social media reports claim that the accident was caused by federal agents in pursuit, Milwaukee police made it clear that the collision was not caused by a chase or pursuit. One of the two drivers involved ran a red light, but both drivers claimed they had green lights.

